        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\[a_{20}=20^2+1=401.\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 401.</p></div>",
