    "poang": "0/2/0",
    "t": "<p>Beräkna \\(\\sum_{k=1}^{10}k^2\\).</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>Använd kvadratsumman</p></li><li><p>\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k^2=\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}6.\\]</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>För</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[n=10\\]:</div></div></li><li><p>\\[\\frac{10\\cdot11\\cdot21}{6}=385.\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 385.</p></div>",
