    "t": "<p>Beräkna</p><p>\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{20}k.\\]</p>",
    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Använd formeln</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[1+2+\\cdots+n=\\frac{n(n+1)}2\\].</div></div></li><li><p>\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{20}k=\\frac{20\\cdot21}{2}=210.\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 210.</p></div>",
