        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a_{48}=300+47\\cdot5=535\\].</div></li><li><p>\\[S_{48}=\\frac{48(300+535)}{2}=20\\,040.\\]</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 20 040 kr</p></div>",
