        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[a_{10}=15+9\\cdot2=33\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 33 sidor</p></div>",
