        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(a_{12}=10+11\\cdot2=32\\) och \\(S_{12}=\\dfrac{12(10+32)}{2}=252\\).</p></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[125+252=377\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 377 kunder</p></div>",
