        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>4 kungar av 52 kort:</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dfrac{4}{52}=\\dfrac{1}{13}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{1}{13}\\approx0{,}0769\\), alltså cirka \\(7{,}69\\,\\%\\)</p></div>",
