    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">a)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>(1,5), (2,4), (3,3), (4,2), (5,1): 5 utfall.</p><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{5}{36}\\approx0{,}139\\), alltså cirka \\(13{,}9\\,\\%\\)</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">b)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>Ingen fyra: \\(5\\cdot5=25\\) utfall. Minst en fyra:</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[36-25=11\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{11}{36}\\approx0{,}306\\), alltså cirka \\(30{,}6\\,\\%\\)</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">c)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>Femma på första men inte andra: 5 utfall, och tvärtom: 5 utfall.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\dfrac{10}{36}=\\dfrac{5}{18}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{5}{18}\\approx0{,}278\\), alltså cirka \\(27{,}8\\,\\%\\)</p></div></div></div><div class=\"facit-del\"><span class=\"facit-mark\">d)</span><div class=\"facit-arbete\"><div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>Summa högst 4: (1,1), (1,2), (2,1), (1,3), (2,2), (3,1): 6 utfall.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[1-\\dfrac{6}{36}=\\dfrac56\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{5}{6}\\approx0{,}833\\), alltså cirka \\(83{,}3\\,\\%\\)</p></div></div></div></div>",
