        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>Alla fyra kast ska vara ettor. Multiplicera sannolikheten 1/6 fyra gånger.</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\left(\\dfrac16\\right)^4=\\dfrac{1}{1\\,296}\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> \\(\\dfrac{1}{1296}\\approx7{,}72\\cdot10^{-4}\\)</p></div>",
