    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><p>Den allmänna termen är</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\binom9k(x^2)^{9-k}\\left(-\\frac3x\\right)^k=\\binom9k(-3)^k x^{18-3k}\\]</div><p>Konstant term:</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[18-3k=0\\Rightarrow k=6\\]</div><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\binom96(-3)^6=84\\cdot729=61\\,236\\]</div><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 61 236</p></div>",
