    "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol type=\"a\"><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(2\\equiv-1\\pmod 3\\), så \\(2^{101}\\equiv(-1)^{101}=-1\\equiv2\\).</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 2</p></li><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2^3=8\\equiv1\\pmod 7\\].</div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[2^{101}=(2^3)^{33}\\cdot2^2\\equiv4\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 4</p></li><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p>\\(3^6=729\\equiv1\\pmod 7\\) och \\(456=6\\cdot76\\), så \\(3^{456}\\equiv1\\).</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 1</p></li><li><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-berakning\"><p>Modulo 10:</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[7^4=2\\,401\\equiv1\\].</div></div></li><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[7^{104}=(7^4)^{26}\\equiv1\\].</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 1</p></li></ol></div>",
