        "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[75v^{\\prime}=75g-15v\\iff v^{\\prime}=g-0{,}2v\\].</div></li><li><p>\\(v=\\dfrac{g}{0{,}2}\\left(1-e^{-0{,}2t}\\right)=49{,}1\\left(1-e^{-0{,}2t}\\right)\\) och \\(v(15)=49{,}1(1-e^{-3})\\approx47\\) m/s.</p></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> cirka 47 m/s</p></div>",
