  "typ": "integral av eˣ",
  "t": "<p>Beräkna \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\ln3}e^x\\,dx\\) exakt.</p>",
  "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\ln3}e^x\\,dx=\\Big[e^x\\Big]_0^{\\ln3}=e^{\\ln3}-e^0=3-1=2\\).</p></div>",
