  "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2\"><p>\\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[-\\cos x\\Big]_0^\\pi=-\\cos\\pi+\\cos0=1+1=2\\).</p></div>",
